      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238377/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Soak onion rings in a bowl of ice water for 1 hour; drain and pat dry with paper towels.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/imzp31DAMbYxHv59xEoOETMs1kk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-238377-fantastic-onion-ring-batter-ddmfs-4x3-Step-01-3358eeacd4aa4536a1f7b9538273557c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238377/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk 1 cup plus 2 tablespoons flour, milk, egg, 2 tablespoons vegetable oil, and salt together in a bowl until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ve0f5N4iHpmT_kJHnSgLZsuQONU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-238377-fantastic-onion-ring-batter-ddmfs-4x3-Step-02-1f68712392b6402483b3f17d82e75444.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238377/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a deep fryer or large saucepan to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Working in batches, dip onion rings in batter until evenly coated; arrange in a single layer on a plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EL0iImCgRntyLfUHx_aw5XApDrE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-238377-fantastic-onion-ring-batter-ddmfs-4x3-Step-03-78cf02b86f894367b031e003c2312e6e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238377/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fry battered onion rings in hot oil in batches, until golden brown and crisp, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
